{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"HELLO"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう寒いよね最近..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モフモフの布団と必需品の抱き枕で寝てるよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勿論あのバナナだよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさてまあやのレギュラー番組 のぎえいごがついに公開収録をやるよ～っ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非是非きてくださいっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして２つ目のレギュラー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂ゴルフ倶楽部ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフさんや片山プロと毎回和気あいあいと(←和気あいあいほめてっ^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たのしく芸人さんたちとやってます～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はゴルゴさんが準レギュラーみたいな感じで来てくださって、楽しく盛り上げてくださいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビシビシと、そして楽しくやってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会やコメントでゴルフ始めたよ～！とか、こうやったらいいよ！って教えてもらえるので楽しみが増えました～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂メンバーもこれからまだ出てくれて益々楽しくなるので皆見てくださいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回ゴルフやった時もう夕方はもう寒かったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして個人PＶ！今回もやりました～"},{"type":"image","src":"cid:C52A3966D07369AD43E431D4F6B8975B-12@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はまだ完成見れてないんです...(*´•×•`*)苦笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てくださった方どうでしたかね？"},{"type":"image","src":"cid:C52A3966D07369AD43E431D4F6B8975B-13@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見たよ～ってコメントもあったので私も早く見たいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思い出はね\nあの人通りの多い目黒川沿い？のとこで、早出さんが倒れて私が大声で助けてるシーンかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早出さんとは沢山共演してるっ♪\nのぎ天が終わって会えてなかったから 久しぶりに会えて嬉しかった～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして監督は、あないかずひさ さんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮っていただいたのは３回目です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優しくて楽しい現場でした～^o^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフさん達も のぎ中のスタッフさん達がしてくださったので、本当に皆 家族みたいに接してくれて楽しい時間でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてPＶといえばこれー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嫉妬の権利"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見ましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チラホラと 怖かったー！とか掃除の格好も まあや？とか、笑ったよ～とかいろいろと コメント読んだよ～笑ありがとうございます^o^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"始めてストーカー役になりました。 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影は朝一から最後まで撮ってもらって、いろんな格好したから楽しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰よりも嫉妬深い女役をやったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分には想像もしてないような役をさせてもらって、怖かったー！って感想があったから、少しは役になれてたのかな⁉︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、皆が疑問に思ってる\n学校に登校してるシーンの正門で清掃員の人"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれも私なんですよ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋に向かってたら楽屋から大歓声聞こえてきて...なんだろ？って思ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マネージャーさんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「みんなPＶのまあやみて盛り上がってたよー」って言ってた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウォーリーを探せ！って感じで まあやを探してみて下さ～い 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいと まあやでメイクさんチクリッ！笑笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう11月なんだね...\nみんなハロウィンとか楽しんだ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは仕事以外ではカボチャ料理しかハロウィンらしいことしてない..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年メンバーとハロウィンやろーみたいになって過ごす予定だったんだけど\n予定合わなくなっちゃったから\n来年とかはハロウィンらしいことしてみたいなー꒰⑅•ᴗ•⑅꒱\nお菓子パーティーとか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"世の中ハロウィンが終わればもうクリスマスなんだね！！！！はやいよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒くなってきたから、皆も風邪をひかないようにそして、受験生の皆 頑張ってー‼️"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会がまた１つ完売になる事が出来ました。\nありがとうございます。\n本当に嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ私は力不足だけど、応援してくれる人を大切にしたい\n笑顔にできる人になれるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆に笑顔とパワーが届きますように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/02/6196899/0020.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}